%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 22d0308a90dc49ae97395f1b651723b5, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_COMM_03_CfoTiming
  questionId: COMM-03
  category: 2
  speakerName: Sales Director
  questionText: >-
    The CFO asks why this should be funded now instead of next fiscal year. The champion looks at you. What do you say?
  answerOptions:
  - {fileID: 11400001}
  - {fileID: 11400002}
  - {fileID: 11400003}
  - {fileID: 11400004}
--- !u!114 &11400001
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d521c6b84db4b8fae30e3785d9e9582, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_COMM_03_A1
  answerText: >-
    Tie delay to quantified exposure, audit deadlines, and the operational cost of current gaps.
  technicalDelta: 1
  commercialDelta: 3
  rapportDelta: 1
  energyDelta: 0
--- !u!114 &11400002
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d521c6b84db4b8fae30e3785d9e9582, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_COMM_03_A2
  answerText: >-
    Explain that threat actors are moving quickly and waiting is dangerous.
  technicalDelta: 1
  commercialDelta: 1
  rapportDelta: 0
  energyDelta: -1
--- !u!114 &11400003
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d521c6b84db4b8fae30e3785d9e9582, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_COMM_03_A3
  answerText: >-
    Offer phased scope that protects the highest-risk use case first.
  technicalDelta: 0
  commercialDelta: 3
  rapportDelta: 2
  energyDelta: 1
--- !u!114 &11400004
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d521c6b84db4b8fae30e3785d9e9582, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_COMM_03_A4
  answerText: >-
    Say budget timing is a business decision and return to technical value.
  technicalDelta: 1
  commercialDelta: -1
  rapportDelta: -1
  energyDelta: -1
